{"title":"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A semipro baseball league has teams with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> players each. League rules state that a player must be paid at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/1/841a3d3625cde659f9a3912bb53ab937b74baf0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" /> dollars, and that the total of all players' salaries for each team cannot exceed <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/0/93040de345b4b3a2aaa008912e87e24bd337a991.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$700,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> dollars. What is the maximum possiblle salary, in dollars, for a single player?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/7105c99d8b18e0cab4be1229abe87d28c13b46b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 270,000 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 385,000 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 400,000 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 430,000 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 700,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"616\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We want to find the maximum any player could make, so assume that everyone else makes the minimum possible and that the combined salaries total the maximum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/0/93040de345b4b3a2aaa008912e87e24bd337a991.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$700,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/7/d97bfc9ce82e21922cad7086d02deff555955282.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$700,000 = 20 * 15,000 + x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"208\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0d25eb31571725a0cea9c4adb7bd8e9461da8c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 400,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"96\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>The maximum any player could make is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/7/5c7ce6f639dc072f6c176370cfdec016a5cca155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$400,000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"16\" /> dollars <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/b/77bd807af4ccf325530a1cc03738b05b5749b527.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow C$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"37\" height=\"13\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B\">2008 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AMC_12B_Probl